{"availability":"available","full":"Emmanuel1118/Learn-ML-Basics","name":"Learn-ML-Basics","description":"A collection of resources that should help and guide your first steps as you learn ML and DL. I am a beginner as well, and these are the resources I found most useful. ","category":"Education","language":null,"stars":91,"forks":8,"created":"2020-07-03T10:06:12Z","updated":"2020-08-21T15:33:22Z","branch":"master","homepage":"","topics":["deep-learning","deep-neural-networks","learn","learning","machine-learning","machinelearning"],"demo":"https://playground.tensorflow.org/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T21:27:09.813Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T21:27:09.813Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T21:27:09.813Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T14:33:18.944Z","stars":91,"forks":8},{"at":"2026-10-04T16:12:32.085Z","stars":91,"forks":8},{"at":"2026-10-06T17:12:26.537Z","stars":91,"forks":8},{"at":"2026-10-08T21:27:09.813Z","stars":91,"forks":8}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Machine Learning is a rapidly evolving field which focuses on computer algorithms that improve over experience. The experience can take the forms of training data, trial and error in a simulated environment, and a lot more.","Using the material and the learning plan found here, you can get from no experience in python to a deep mathmatical and practical understanding of key ideas in ML, and more importantly you should be able to know what to do to continue learning independently.","My goal with this repository is to create an easy to follow and well paced program that relies entirely on online resources. I am not seeking to create a classification of all available resources on the topic, as there are many of those, and in order for them to be of any use one must already know the basics of the field (if this is what you seek here is a repo that does exactly that, and I added more in the more resources section)."],"features":[],"sourc